      "widgets_values": [
        "N-36 Pyramid Blend — seamless multi-band composite.\n\nimage_a = original portrait, image_b = the same portrait graded with the bundled cinematic LUT (N-34), mask = the face box from N-38 Face Detect Lite. A hard box mask would leave a visible rectangle; the Laplacian pyramid blends each frequency band with its own softness, so the graded face melts into the original frame.\nlevels = 6: more levels = wider, softer transition. Try a person mask from any segmentation node for real composites."
      ]
    }
